Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every company is going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:01.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,to get hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:02.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,If it's an open source
