Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:04.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,throw an agent at it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:05.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,anyway and just maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:07.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,not go super deep but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:08.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,just like a cursory scan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,of like what does the
