Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:13.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,challenge is that maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:16.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,it looks great but then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:17.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,their hosting is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:18.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,absolutely abysmal and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:19.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,so like that doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:20.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually give you the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:21.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,full picture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:22.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,maybe you just take the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:23.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,view that like every
