Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:29.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I don't know maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,that's like a kind of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:31.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,defeatist view but I
